    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap 3-Axis Quadcopter Flight PID Stabilization &amp; Motor Mixer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Architecture:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Cascaded Dual-Loop Control:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Outer Angle Loop: Desired angle (deg) -&gt; Gyro Rate Setpoint (deg/s).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Inner Rate Loop: Gyro Rate Error -&gt; Motor Axis Torque Output (Roll, Pitch, Yaw).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Quadcopter X-Configuration Motor Mixer:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Motor 1 (Front-Right, CCW): Throttle - Roll + Pitch + Yaw</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Motor 2 (Rear-Right, CW): Throttle - Roll - Pitch - Yaw</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Motor 3 (Rear-Left, CCW): Throttle + Roll - Pitch + Yaw</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Motor 4 (Front-Left, CW): Throttle + Roll + Pitch - Yaw</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All operations use Q16.16 fixed-point arithmetic. Zero float, zero heap. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
